# Git and GitHub stay with the user

The GitHub repo already exists: `https://github.com/umeraamir69/ApplySafe.git` (`origin` on `main`).

Do not do GitHub or git write actions. That includes:

- `git commit`, `git add`, `git push`


When work should be saved or published, stop and ask the user to commit and push. Say which files changed. Do not run the commands yourself.
